{
  "name": "Day 41 Solution: Multi-Modal AI",
  "description": "Runs text, image, and audio analysis in parallel via OpenAI nodes (gpt-4o text, gpt-4o vision message content array, whisper-1 transcription), merges the three results by position, and synthesizes them into one cross-modal analysis.",
  "tags": [
    "week-06",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-41",
    "openai",
    "multi-modal",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 41 Solution: Multi-Modal AI\n\nSends the same request's text, image URL, and audio URL to three parallel OpenAI calls (text analysis with gpt-4o, image analysis with a gpt-4o vision message content array, and Whisper transcription), merges the three results by position, and synthesizes them in a final Cross-Modal Analysis call.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key with access to a vision-capable model and Whisper.\n\n**Note:** In a real n8n instance the Audio Transcription node needs binary audio data, not a bare URL — insert an HTTP Request node (Response Format: File) before it to download input_audio_url first. Simplified here for teaching clarity.\n\n**Reference:** WEEK_06_AI_AGENTS/DAILY_TASKS/DAY_41_Multi_Modal_AI.md",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "multi-modal-ai-trigger",
      "name": "Multi-Modal AI Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "multi-modal-ai",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-multi-modal-input",
      "name": "Prepare Multi-Modal Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "input_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "input_image_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.image_url }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "input_audio_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.audio_url }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text-analysis",
      "name": "Text Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        800,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "Analyze this text for sentiment, key topics, and insights."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.input_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "image-analysis",
      "name": "Image Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        800,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an image analysis assistant."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ [ { \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Describe this image in detail: objects, colors, composition, and any visible text.\" }, { \"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": { \"url\": $json.input_image_url, \"detail\": \"low\" } } ] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-transcription",
      "name": "Audio Transcription",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        800,
        680
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "operation": "transcribe",
        "model": "whisper-1",
        "audioUrl": "={{ $json.input_audio_url }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "combine-modalities",
      "name": "Combine Modalities",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1080,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition",
        "numberInputs": 3,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cross-modal-analysis",
      "name": "Cross-Modal Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1360,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You analyze content across multiple modalities and provide integrated insights."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Text Analysis: ' + $('Text Analysis').item.json.message.content + '\\n\\nImage Analysis: ' + $('Image Analysis').item.json.message.content + '\\n\\nAudio Transcript: ' + $('Audio Transcription').item.json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "maxTokens": 800
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Multi-Modal AI Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Multi-Modal Input",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Multi-Modal Input": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Text Analysis",
